  27:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   [..]       
  28:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       The STM32H7xx device family integrates two analog comparators instances
  29:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       COMP1 and COMP2:
  30:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The COMP input minus (inverting input) and input plus (non inverting input)
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Made\AppData\Local\Temp\ccjfWqrf.s 			page 2


  31:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           can be set to internal references or to GPIO pins
  32:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           (refer to GPIO list in reference manual).
  33:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   
  34:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The COMP output level is available using HAL_COMP_GetOutputLevel()
  35:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           and can be redirected to other peripherals: GPIO pins (in mode
  36:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           alternate functions for comparator), timers.
  37:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           (refer to GPIO list in reference manual).
  38:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   
  39:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Pairs of comparators instances can be combined in window mode
  40:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           (2 consecutive instances odd and even COMP<x> and COMP<x+1>).
  41:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   
  42:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The comparators have interrupt capability through the EXTI controller
  43:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           with wake-up from sleep and stop modes:
  44:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP1 is internally connected to EXTI Line 20
  45:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP2 is internally connected to EXTI Line 21
  46:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   
