  48:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           From the corresponding IRQ handler, the right interrupt source can be retrieved
  49:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           using macro __HAL_COMP_COMP1_EXTI_GET_FLAG() and __HAL_COMP_COMP2_EXTI_GET_FLAG().
