  53:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****             ##### How to use this driver #####
  54:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   ================================================================================
  55:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   [..]
  56:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       This driver provides functions to configure and program the comparator instances of 
  57:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       STM32H7xx devices.
  58:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  59:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       To use the comparator, perform the following steps:
  60:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   
  61:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#)  Initialize the COMP low level resources by implementing the HAL_COMP_MspInit():
  62:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Configure the GPIO connected to comparator inputs plus and minus in analog mode
  63:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****            using HAL_GPIO_Init().
  64:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) If needed, configure the GPIO connected to comparator output in alternate function mode
  65:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****            using HAL_GPIO_Init().
  66:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) If required enable the COMP interrupt by configuring and enabling EXTI line in Interrupt
  67:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****            selecting the desired sensitivity level using HAL_GPIO_Init() function. After that enabl
  68:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****            interrupt vector using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ() function.
  69:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   
  70:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Configure the comparator using HAL_COMP_Init() function:
  71:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the input minus (inverting input)
  72:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the input plus (non-inverting input)
  73:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the hysteresis
  74:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the blanking source
  75:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the output polarity  
  76:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the power mode
  77:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the window mode
  78:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       -@@- HAL_COMP_Init() calls internally __HAL_RCC_SYSCFG_CLK_ENABLE()
  79:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           to enable internal control clock of the comparators.
  80:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           However, this is a legacy strategy. 
  81:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           Therefore, for compatibility anticipation, it is recommended to 
  82:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           implement __HAL_RCC_SYSCFG_CLK_ENABLE() in "HAL_COMP_MspInit()".
  83:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           In STM32H7,COMP clock enable  __HAL_RCC_COMP12_CLK_ENABLE() must 
  84:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           be implemented by user in "HAL_COMP_MspInit()".
  85:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Reconfiguration on-the-fly of comparator can be done by calling again
  86:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           function HAL_COMP_Init() with new input structure parameters values.
  87:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Made\AppData\Local\Temp\ccjfWqrf.s 			page 3


  88:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Enable the comparator using HAL_COMP_Start() or HAL_COMP_Start_IT()to be enabled 
  89:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           with the interrupt through NVIC of the CPU. 
  90:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       Note: HAL_COMP_Start_IT() must be called after each interrupt otherwise the interrupt
  91:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       mode will stay disabled.
  92:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       
  93:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Use HAL_COMP_GetOutputLevel() or HAL_COMP_TriggerCallback()
  94:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           functions to manage comparator outputs(output level or events)
  95:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  96:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Disable the comparator using HAL_COMP_Stop() or HAL_COMP_Stop_IT() 
  97:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           to disable the interrupt too.
  98:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  99:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) De-initialize the comparator using HAL_COMP_DeInit() function.
 100:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 101:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) For safety purpose, comparator configuration can be locked using HAL_COMP_Lock() function
 102:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****           The only way to unlock the comparator is a device hardware reset.
