1133:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @brief  Return the output level (high or low) of the selected comparator. 
1134:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @note   The output level depends on the selected polarity.
1135:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *         If the polarity is not inverted:
1136:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is low when the input plus is at a lower
1137:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
1138:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is high when the input plus is at a higher
1139:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
