1142:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
1143:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is low when the input plus is at a higher
1144:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
1145:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @param  hcomp  COMP handle
